{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "snow-country",
  "chunk_id": "snow-country-chunk-0424",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00424",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我担心会发疯。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I was afraid I was going mad.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00424",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "不知为什么，我一味苦思冥想，然而还是想不通，连我自己也不明白。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "For some reason, I kept brooding desperately, but I still could not make sense of it, and even I did not understand myself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00424",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "真可怕啊。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was truly frightening.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00424",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "一会儿也睡不着，只有出去赴宴时，身体才好受一点。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I could not sleep even for a moment, and only when I went out to entertain at banquets did my body feel a little better.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00424",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我做过各种各样的梦。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I had all kinds of dreams.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00424",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "连饭也不能好好吃。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I could not even eat properly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00424",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "在大热天里，把针截在铺席上，戳了又拔，拔了又戳，没完没了的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In the heat of the day, I would stick a needle into the matting, pull it out, then stick it in and pull it out again, endlessly.”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
